        "title": "P1: CodeEditorFeatures.codeActions() offers only actions with an edit, for both editors (the CodeMirror test's filter); every action the service makes has one today, so Monaco shows the same. The CodeMirror hover now says as much as Monaco's (codeHover's detail, plain by default), no longer always the compiler's words.",
